    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/ccfa5b6edc3e7d9f55eb29809f81368e.poster.avif?t=1754609400\" width=560 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/ccfa5b6edc3e7d9f55eb29809f81368e.webm?t=1754609400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 years ago, Vittoria's father was murdered by a worker in their orchard. It's now 1925, and the man makes a sudden reappearance in her life as a wealthy Don.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she meets a wayward circus performer who also has a bone to pick with the Don, the two scheme to teach him a lesson, at a deadly price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/027f158cd1cc281fbb7ba65063e3e0e6.poster.avif?t=1754609400\" width=560 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/027f158cd1cc281fbb7ba65063e3e0e6.webm?t=1754609400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-rich maps inspired by real locations in Sicily</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of hand-drawn illustrations and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game by a day and night cycle over one week</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A knife-wielding clown, a haunting, and an atmospheric circus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/fe7e9b47e70f1296a5019899e045c56a.poster.avif?t=1754609400\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/fe7e9b47e70f1296a5019899e045c56a.webm?t=1754609400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the <i>verismo</i>\u00a0(realism) operas of the early 1900s.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/ccfa5b6edc3e7d9f55eb29809f81368e.poster.avif?t=1754609400\" width=560 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/ccfa5b6edc3e7d9f55eb29809f81368e.webm?t=1754609400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 years ago, Vittoria's father was murdered by a worker in their orchard. It's now 1925, and the man makes a sudden reappearance in her life as a wealthy Don.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she meets a wayward circus performer who also has a bone to pick with the Don, the two scheme to teach him a lesson, at a deadly price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/027f158cd1cc281fbb7ba65063e3e0e6.poster.avif?t=1754609400\" width=560 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/027f158cd1cc281fbb7ba65063e3e0e6.webm?t=1754609400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-rich maps inspired by real locations in Sicily</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of hand-drawn illustrations and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game by a day and night cycle over one week</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A knife-wielding clown, a haunting, and an atmospheric circus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/fe7e9b47e70f1296a5019899e045c56a.poster.avif?t=1754609400\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242730/extras/fe7e9b47e70f1296a5019899e045c56a.webm?t=1754609400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the <i>verismo</i>\u00a0(realism) operas of the early 1900s.</p>",
